      "body": "<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: summarize by coderabbit.ai -->\n<!-- review_stack_entry_start -->\n\n<a href=\"https://app.coderabbit.ai/change-stack/verl-project/verl/pull/8262?scope=ghh_OusAJGA4HG8ljoOV0wJvVx8NmnZIjc2DdjmxOu0xZWA&amp;cs_source=review_comment\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-in-coderabbit-ui-dark.svg?v=3\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-in-coderabbit-ui.svg?v=3\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-in-coderabbit-ui.svg?v=3\" alt=\"Review in Change Stack →\" height=\"32\"></picture></a>\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_end -->\n<!-- recent_review_start -->\n\nNo actionable comments were generated in the recent review. 🎉\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>ℹ️ Recent review info</strong></summary>\n<dl>\n<dd>\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>⚙️ Run configuration</strong></summary>\n<dl>\n<dd>\n\n- **Configuration used**: Organization UI\n- **Review profile**: CHILL\n- **Plan**: Advanced\n- **Run ID**: `1355f9f8-3882-4d4b-82bf-2f9bb1dd5e24`\n\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>📥 Commits</strong></summary>\n<dl>\n<dd>\n\nReviewing files that changed from the base of the PR and between 18cfb74852a053a27dcf301d3318a093be81b628 and 21f4039734550fbd2a193b2a44552a3cc043a9ec.\n\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>📒 Files selected for processing: 2</strong></summary>\n<dl>\n<dd>\n\n* `tests/workers/reward_manager/test_prime_on_cpu.py`\n* `verl/workers/reward_manager/prime.py`\n\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</details>\n\n**Included review availability:** This review used your included allowance. Your plan provides up to 10 included reviews per hour; 9 remain after this review.\n\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</details>\n\n\n\n\n\n<!-- recent_review_end -->\n<!-- walkthrough_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>📝 Summary</strong></summary>\n<dl>\n<dd>\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Improvements**\n  * Reward scoring now handles results returned as dictionaries containing a numeric `score`, alongside existing numeric and sequence results.\n* **Tests**\n  * Added CPU coverage for reward scoring with dictionary-based and numeric results.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\nPrime reward scoring now converts dictionary results by reading the `\"score\"` value as a float. New CPU tests check dictionary and float results.\n\n**Changes: Prime reward scoring**\n\n|Layer / File(s)|Summary|\n|:---|:---|\n|**Score result handling and CPU tests** <br> `verl/workers/reward_manager/prime.py`, `tests/workers/reward_manager/test_prime_on_cpu.py`|Dictionary results now use `result[\"score\"]` converted to a float. CPU tests check dictionary results scoring `1.0` and float results scoring `0.5`.|\n\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</details>\n\n<!-- walkthrough_end -->\n<!-- change_assessment_start -->\n**Priority:** ➖ Normal\n\n<!-- change_assessment_commit:\"21f4039734550fbd2a193b2a44552a3cc043a9ec\" -->\n**Severity of issue fixed:** Medium\n<!-- change_assessment_end -->\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Merge Risk:</strong> <strong>⚪ Minimal</strong> · up to <code>21f40</code></summary>\n<dl>\n<dd>\n\n<!-- final_review_risk_start -->\n<!-- final_review_risk_label\n**Merge Risk:** **⚪ Minimal** · up to `21f40`\n-->\n<!-- final_review_risk_coverage:{\"sourceCommitId\":\"21f4039734550fbd2a193b2a44552a3cc043a9ec\",\"coveredCommitId\":\"21f4039734550fbd2a193b2a44552a3cc043a9ec\",\"kind\":\"reviewed\"} -->\n\nThe change handles dictionary score responses and adds CPU coverage for dictionary and float results; no issue in the supplied context warrants delaying merge.\n<!-- final_review_risk_end -->\n\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</details>\n<!-- pre_merge_checks_walkthrough_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Pre-merge checks: <sup><picture><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/pre-merge-checks-counter-passed-14-v2.svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" align=\"middle\" alt=\"Passed\" title=\"Passed\"></picture></sup> 4 · <sup><picture><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/pre-merge-checks-counter-failed-14-v2.svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" align=\"middle\" alt=\"Failed\" title=\"Failed\"></picture></sup> 1</strong></summary>\n<dl>\n<dd>\n\n<strong><sup><picture><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/pre-merge-checks-counter-failed-14-v2.svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" align=\"middle\" alt=\"Failed\" title=\"Failed\"></picture></sup> Failed checks: 1 warning</strong>\n\n|     Check name     |                                              Status                                              | Explanation                                                                                                                                                                                | Resolution                                                                         |\n| :---------------- | :----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------: | :----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | :--------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Docstring Coverage | ![Warning](https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/pre-merge-checks-warning.svg) | Docstring coverage is 20.00% which is insufficient. The required threshold is 80.00%. Docstring coverage is scoped to functions touched by this diff. Analyzed 5 functions across 2 files. | Write docstrings for the functions missing them to satisfy the coverage threshold. |\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong><sup>